Add resetState() methods to DocHeaderComponent, ButtonBar, and MenuRegistry.

These #[Autoconfigure(public: true)] shared services accumulate
per-request state: ButtonBar::$buttons via addButton(), MenuRegistry::
$menus via addMenu(), and DocHeaderComponent holds references to both.
Under PHP-FPM fresh instances are created per request. Under
long-running runtimes the same instances persist, causing duplicate
buttons and ghost menu dropdowns after every request.

Add public resetState() methods following the precedent of
PageRenderer/AssetCollector/MetaTagManagerRegistry getState/updateState.

--- a/Classes/Template/Components/ButtonBar.php
